# Root .dockerignore — this is the file Docker actually reads when
# building from the repo root with `-f oxiz-smtcomp/Dockerfile`.
# Keeps target/, git metadata, wasm artefacts, and other bulk out of
# the build context so the builder stage stays fast.
target/
**/target/
.git/
.github/
**/*.pdf
**/*.log
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
oxiz-wasm/pkg/
oxiz-wasm/target/
bench/logs/
**/.DS_Store
# The root Cargo.lock is git-ignored as of 0.3.1 and the builder stage no
# longer copies it; excluding it here keeps a stale local lockfile from
# silently entering the build context. Root-only by design: per-crate
# lockfiles such as bench/z3_parity/Cargo.lock are untouched.
/Cargo.lock
